  "description": "The installation of replacement double glazed uPVC windows in rare and side elevation at a first floor flat known as Flat 3 of 94 Woolstone Road SE23 2TH.  The proposed windows will match the approved windows for Flats 1, 2 and 4 (ref. DC/14/086781) in terms of design, materials, colour, proportions and opening method. No change to the size or position of existing openings.\n\n-----------------------\nDear Planning Officer,\n\nI am writing to clarify the description of development for the above application.\nWhile the application title refers to “all elevations”, the proposed works relate only to the replacement of existing windows serving Flat 3 on the rear and side elevations of the building. No works are proposed to the front elevation.\nThe submitted drawings accurately reflect the scope of the proposed works.\nI would be grateful if this clarification could be noted on the application file, and please let me know if any further action is required from my side.\n\nKind Regards \nDeji Juwa ",
